    <img src="JgmIbUVQho7GctxAAFUcxZ8snXg" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="140" width="380" height="214"/>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="140" width="380" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>制造业智能化转型的必然要求</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="170" width="380" height="90">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(56,56,56,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>"工业4.0""中国制造2025"推动制造业由自动化向柔性化、智能化升级。在物流仓储、电子装配、食品医药等环节，分拣是物料流转的核心，其效率与柔性直接决定整条产线的产能与成本。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="278" width="380" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>传统分拣方式难以适应柔性需求</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="308" width="380" height="100">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(56,56,56,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>人工分拣劳动强度大、一致性差、人力成本上升；传统工业机械臂依赖固定示教编程，仅适应结构化环境，对目标位姿变化、杂乱堆叠及未知物体的适应能力不足。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="366" width="380" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)" bold="true">
        <p>深度学习与智能规划带来新机遇</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="392" width="380" height="34">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(56,56,56,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>深度学习赋予非结构化环境感知能力；改进规划算法保障轨迹实时最优。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="438" width="3" height="44">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(0,47,167,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="98" topLeftY="438" width="782" height="44">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(17,17,17,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(0,47,167,1)">研究意义　</span>融合深度学习视觉感知与改进路径规划，提升复杂分拣场景下的识别精度、抓取成功率与分拣效率。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="80" startY="490" endX="880" endY="490">
